From 789bad62df6f033754c56448aeca355366bdcca6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:16:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: Port the core Wineland HUD.

Render DXVK HUD data during presentation, including HDR output, scaled
layouts, graphs and the current present mode. Keep the frame pacer intact
and leave presentation-latency telemetry out of this backport.

Bound HUD request-ring reuse so queued vertices remain valid until their
presentation callback retires. Allocate rendering resources lazily.
---
